                  "id": "tVs8C",
                  "name": "mapNote4",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "content": "Open × mailbox_answer    → ? Awaiting answer        (subagent waiting for user via mailbox.question)\nOpen × mailbox_result    → ⇣ Awaiting result        (root waiting for subagent's mailbox.result)\nOpen × mailbox_failure   → ⚠ Awaiting failure ack   (edge — system waits on failure terminal ack)\nOpen × operator_command  → ⌘ Awaiting operator      (formal pending operator action)\nResolved × any kind      → ✓ Resolved               (kind context inherited from parent card)\nCancelled × any kind     → ⊘ Cancelled              (kind context inherited from parent card)",
                  "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
