                  "content": "Atomic indicator: shared (no delta — same FSM applies).\nDirectional reading lives on the Dependency Card composite, not here:\n   root  → typically holds Open × mailbox_result      (\"my subagent owes me a result\")\n   sub   → typically holds Open × mailbox_answer      (\"I need an answer from the user\")\n   sub   → can also hold Open × operator_command      (\"a formal command paused me\")",
                  "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
