                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "X1C26g",
                  "name": "sepMap5",
                  "fill": "$border",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Y0XxRv",
                  "name": "sectionMap5",
                  "fill": "$text",
                  "content": "Schema → visual mapping",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "L4XDZ",
                  "name": "mapNote5",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "content": "handoff   → → Handoff   blue       (delegation handover · root↔subagent)\nfeedback  → ✎ Feedback  purple     (annotation/steering · usually root → subagent)\nquestion  → ? Question  amber      (subagent → root → user · pairs with mailbox_answer dependency)\nanswer    → ↩ Answer    cyan       (user via root → subagent · resolves a question)\nresult    → ✓ Result    emerald    (subagent → root · terminal success · carries workItemId FK per BEAT-01b)\nfailure   → ✕ Failure   red        (subagent → root · terminal failure · CHECK constraint enforces no mutation)\ncontrol   → ⌘ Control   slate      (operator-issued cancel/pause · root → subagent)",
                  "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "IcUw8",
                  "name": "sepDelta5",
                  "fill": "$border",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "IYG3N",
                  "name": "sectionDelta5",
                  "fill": "$text",
                  "content": "Delta orchestrator vs subagent — directionality canonical per kind (per I9 + I10)",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Z0p5RY",
                  "name": "deltaNote5",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "content": "Atomic chip: shared (no kind-level delta).\nDirection modifier ↑/↓ overlays the SAME chip when context demands (Mailbox Inbox/Outbox).\n\nCanonical directionality per kind:\n  handoff   root ⇄ subagent       (bidirectional — root delegates OR subagent re-handoffs)\n  feedback  root → subagent       (steering only)\n  question  subagent → root       (root forwards to user · I10 boundary)\n  answer    user via root → sub   (resolves question)\n  result    subagent → root       (terminal success)\n  failure   subagent → root       (terminal failure)\n  control   root → subagent       (operator-issued)\n\nI9: subagents do NOT message peers. I10: root is the ONLY human-facing boundary.",
                  "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "UFYGL",
                  "name": "sepAna5",
                  "fill": "$border",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "b04UNx",
                  "name": "sectionAna5",
                  "fill": "$text",
                  "content": "Anatomy",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "H5DSS",
                  "name": "anatomyNote5",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "content": "chip:   24px height · radius 9999 · padding [4,10,4,10] · gap 6\nglyph:  monochrome semantic per kind (→ ✎ ? ↩ ✓ ✕ ⌘) · Inter 11–12 / 700\nlabel:  Inter 12 / 500 · always capitalized noun form\ndir mod: ↑ outbound (lighter shade · 7DD3FC/6EE7B7) prefixed before kind glyph\ntooltip: \"{kind} · {sender role} → {receiver role} · {createdAt}\"",
                  "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
