                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "E5wm5",
                  "name": "sectionDelta7",
                  "fill": "$text",
                  "content": "Delta orchestrator vs subagent",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hwnQg",
                  "name": "deltaNote7",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "content": "Same anatomy. Identity area swaps:\n  subagent     → ● {Name}                     (hover chip reveals [TYPE] role · convention from existing design system)\n  orchestrator → Orchestrator · session       (no dot · no hover chip · root is the session itself)\nSource tag swaps statistically (subagent=mailbox, orchestrator=chat) but the schema field is the same atomic.\nIn activity panel the orchestrator card is rare — chat panel IS the orchestrator's representation. Card surfaces in coordination overview, recovery views, capacity queue.",
                  "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "XAcFP",
                  "name": "sepAna7",
                  "fill": "$border",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uq07W",
                  "name": "sectionAna7",
                  "fill": "$text",
                  "content": "Anatomy",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "G2qyF",
                  "name": "anatomyNote7",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "content": "card:    780w · radius 10 · padding [14,16,14,16] · gap 8 · fill #11161E · stroke #21262D 1px\nL1:      identity (●Name or session) + status pill + (retry if #2+) + (dep if blocked)\nL2:      task excerpt — Inter 13 / normal · text-#C9D1D9 · truncate 80–120 chars\nL3:      source tag + relative time + (lease if active/expired) + (errorCode if failed)\ndata join: source resolved from {sourceKind, mailboxMessageId|sessionMessageId|operatorCommandId}\npills shown only when meaningful — NEVER all 6 atomics at once",
                  "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "D109y",
              "name": "Composite — Cancel Cascade Summary",
              "width": 1500,
              "fill": "$bg",
              "cornerRadius": 16,
              "stroke": "$border",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "strokeAlignment": "inner",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 24,
              "padding": 48,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "QrQvA",
