                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "baZRF",
                  "name": "anatomyNoteCC",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "content": "Single anatomy · scope-adaptive content. NO destructive red — neutral closure.\ncard: 640w · radius 8 · padding [14,16,14,16] · gap 10 · stroke --border-decorative #484F58\nL1: ⊘ icon (gray) + title + (optional ⚠ N reconciling chip when partial fail) + spacer + time\nL2: scope subtitle (mono 11 muted)\ndivider\nlist: per-affected-agent rows · ● dot + name + phase + spacer + ⊘ Cancelled (right-aligned)\ndivider\nfooter: [Send a new message] (accent-green) + spacer + View cascade timeline → (chat-info)\n\nDelta orchestrator/subagent: NONE. Cancel always user-initiated → root cascade. No subagent variant.\nTitle adapts: \"Session cancelled\" / \"Active runs cancelled\" / \"Pending work cancelled\".\nList content adapts: filtered by scope (no preservation talk, no failure annotations — those are noise).",
                  "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
